{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to PACK: Post Apocalyptic Cleaning Kit, the first-person adventure where tidying up is the ultimate objective! You pilot a state-of-the-art robot, initially designed for light disaster recovery\u2014but let\u2019s be real, the world went full 'end times.' That's fine! A good robot never misses a deadline. Get ready to power up your chassis and dive into the abandoned, dusty ruins of civilization. Use your built-in tools to wash away years of grime, vacuum up trash for compression into resource cubes, and restore old structures. Play solo and explore the funny, sad and mysterious lore behind humanity's sudden disappearance, or grab up to three friends and turn the apocalypse into a satisfying cleanup party! Get ready to scrub, scavenge, and discover\u2014it\u2019s time to make the apocalypse spotless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Washing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The handy washing tool is used to wash away various types of grime, stains, or even biological residue. While the washer can move small objects, there are better tools for that job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.poster.avif?t=1769097300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.webm?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.mp4?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vacuuming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vacuum tool is designed to collect small items and surface debris like leaves and papers. However, the vacuum has a capacity limit. When full, you will need to eject a compressed trash cube that can then be processed at the recycling station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/bf65c4fef5b6a12468e4866171b79cb7.poster.avif?t=1769097300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/bf65c4fef5b6a12468e4866171b79cb7.webm?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/bf65c4fef5b6a12468e4866171b79cb7.mp4?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The robot's integrated graspers are used to move objects and deliver trash cubes\u2014along with other debris too large for the vacuum\u2014to the recycling station. These recycled items provide valuable resources that can be used to repair broken objects in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/501295ff9b01d595a177644d1bffe4ea.poster.avif?t=1769097300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/501295ff9b01d595a177644d1bffe4ea.webm?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/501295ff9b01d595a177644d1bffe4ea.mp4?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repair</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the resources acquired from recycling to repair broken equipment and objects in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.poster.avif?t=1769097300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.webm?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.mp4?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean:\u00a0</strong>Deploy the high-pressure spray washer to instantly clear biological residue, stubborn grime, and environmental corruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vacuum:\u00a0</strong>Activate the tactical vacuum to sweep up debris and instantly forge compressed <strong>Trash Cubes</strong>\u2014the ultimate loot for easy disposal and resource acquisition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recycle:\u00a0</strong>Utilize the robot graspers to efficiently recover debris, collect ejected trash cubes, and transport them to the recycling station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair:\u00a0</strong>Utilize recovered resources to forge necessary components, instantly repairing critical equipment and restoring broken structures in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore:</strong> Discover echo spheres and environmental clues to piece together the narrative and uncover the full story of the collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op:</strong> Team up with up to 3 friends<strong>\u00a0</strong>for streamlined co-op cleaning collaborative restoration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3286440?t=1769097300","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3286440?t=1769097300","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/78e1b410f4fd463eefd11241ea82c614636abc4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769097300","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/78e1b410f4fd463eefd11241ea82c614636abc4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769097300","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to PACK: Post Apocalyptic Cleaning Kit, the first-person adventure where tidying up is the ultimate objective! You pilot a state-of-the-art robot, initially designed for light disaster recovery\u2014but let\u2019s be real, the world went full 'end times.' That's fine! A good robot never misses a deadline. Get ready to power up your chassis and dive into the abandoned, dusty ruins of civilization. Use your built-in tools to wash away years of grime, vacuum up trash for compression into resource cubes, and restore old structures. Play solo and explore the funny, sad and mysterious lore behind humanity's sudden disappearance, or grab up to three friends and turn the apocalypse into a satisfying cleanup party! Get ready to scrub, scavenge, and discover\u2014it\u2019s time to make the apocalypse spotless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Washing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The handy washing tool is used to wash away various types of grime, stains, or even biological residue. While the washer can move small objects, there are better tools for that job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.poster.avif?t=1769097300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.webm?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.mp4?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vacuuming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vacuum tool is designed to collect small items and surface debris like leaves and papers. However, the vacuum has a capacity limit. When full, you will need to eject a compressed trash cube that can then be processed at the recycling station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/bf65c4fef5b6a12468e4866171b79cb7.poster.avif?t=1769097300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/bf65c4fef5b6a12468e4866171b79cb7.webm?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/bf65c4fef5b6a12468e4866171b79cb7.mp4?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The robot's integrated graspers are used to move objects and deliver trash cubes\u2014along with other debris too large for the vacuum\u2014to the recycling station. These recycled items provide valuable resources that can be used to repair broken objects in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/501295ff9b01d595a177644d1bffe4ea.poster.avif?t=1769097300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/501295ff9b01d595a177644d1bffe4ea.webm?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/501295ff9b01d595a177644d1bffe4ea.mp4?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repair</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the resources acquired from recycling to repair broken equipment and objects in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.poster.avif?t=1769097300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.webm?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.mp4?t=1769097300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean:\u00a0</strong>Deploy the high-pressure spray washer to instantly clear biological residue, stubborn grime, and environmental corruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vacuum:\u00a0</strong>Activate the tactical vacuum to sweep up debris and instantly forge compressed <strong>Trash Cubes</strong>\u2014the ultimate loot for easy disposal and resource acquisition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recycle:\u00a0</strong>Utilize the robot graspers to efficiently recover debris, collect ejected trash cubes, and transport them to the recycling station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair:\u00a0</strong>Utilize recovered resources to forge necessary components, instantly repairing critical equipment and restoring broken structures in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore:</strong> Discover echo spheres and environmental clues to piece together the narrative and uncover the full story of the collapse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op:</strong> Team up with up to 3 friends<strong>\u00a0</strong>for streamlined co-op cleaning collaborative restoration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nitrous Butterfly"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/0d3911ef7a8857f4e2a4e69e2317533808b71759/header.jpg?t=1769097300","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3286440/428661413/75d92a072f3861803fbee16d8742d57d37dafd7e/1765294465/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765296647","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3286440/428661413/75d92a072f3861803fbee16d8742d57d37dafd7e/1765294465/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765296647","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamsta